","title":"Demo Patch 0.7.8 Released","summary":"Devlog 0.7.8Enhancements:Enabled keyboard controls for common actions while in a combat run:Esc Key - pauses the game and opens the Options Menu, also backs out of any open menusP Key/Space Key - pauses the gameS Key - opens the Spellbook MenuH Key - opens the Heroes MenuA Key - opens the Achievements Menu1-6 Keys - cast the spell in the associated spell slot for that numberNumPad 1-6 Keys - cast the spell in the associated spell slot for that numberTooltips have been added for all in combat UI ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-24T20:48:41Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114040647","verified_at":"2026-10-25T01:51:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5316070-1846018067942629","game_id":"steam-5316070","kind":"update","title":"Demo Patch 0.7.7 Released","summary":"Steam Achievements are now live!If you earned an achievement before the Steam version was enabled, it should automatically activate it for you when you play again.Additional Changes:Several achievements have had their requirements updated to be more balanced.Fixed a bug that resulted in the wrong hero being selected when doing a full game reset.Minor updates to enemy visuals and reward icons.Additional SFX added for certain actions or situations.Visual enhancements and polish added to some menu ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-13T01:41:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067942629","verified_at":"2026-10-21T00:38:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5316070-1846018067927125","game_id":"steam-5316070","kind":"update","title":"Demo Patch 0.7.6 Released","summary":"General enhancements to the spellbook page to make management of 